andatory orchestrator-level review, and assembles either a Graphite PR stack or a plain-git branch stack depending on tool availability.", "input": {"hint": "<design-doc-path> [--effort N] [--concurrency N] [--dry-run] [--resume <PLAN_ID>] [--instructions \"...\"] [--no-graphite] [--auto-pr]"}, "name": "execute-plan"}, {"_meta": {"bareName": "game-assets", "path": "/Users/ylmacstudio/.grok/bundled/skills/game-assets/SKILL.md", "qualifiedName": "bundled:game-assets", "scope": "bundled"}, "description": "Engine-ready game art, 2D sprites to 3D models", "input": null, "name": "game-assets"}, {"_meta": {"bareName": "imagine", "path": "/Users/ylmacstudio/.grok/bundled/skills/imagine/SKILL.md", "qualifiedName": "bundled:imagine", "scope": "bundled"}, "description": "Prompting and workflow guidance for Imagine image and video tools", "input": null, "name": "bundled:imagine"}, {"_meta": {"bareName": "implement", "path": "/Users/ylmacstudio/.grok/bundled/skills/implement/SKILL.md", "qualifiedName": "bundled:implement", "scope": "bundled"}, "description": "Run the full implement-review-fix loop using implementer and reviewer personas. Supports effort-based multi-reviewer scaling (2–7 reviewers) with automatic specialization selection. Includes memory-based feedback loop that learns from past review patterns. Loops until all reviewers find 0 issues of any severity.", "input": {"hint": "[--effort N] <description of what to implement>"}, "name": "implement"}, {"_meta": {"bareName": "learn", "path": "/Users/ylmacstudio/.grok/bundled/skills/learn/SKILL.md", "qualifiedName": "bundled:learn", "scope": "bundled"}, "description": "Learn from your own Grok Build sessions and tune your setup: add skills for things you keep typing, fix stale skill instructions, and retire skills, plugins, or MCP servers you never use. Use on \"/learn\", \"learn from my traces\", \"what skills do I never use\". Not for summarizing sessions into notes or memory.", "input": {"hint": "[--mode step|auto|repor