la-project-runner", "path": "/Users/ylmacstudio/.grok/skills/zcode-kaola-project-runner/SKILL.md", "qualifiedName": "user:zcode-kaola-project-runner", "scope": "user"}, "description": "Use when the controlling Agent should communicate with a ZCode main conversation through an exact owned ACP session by starting it, reading evidence, sending Agent-selected prompts or keys, reading replies, and stopping only that session.", "input": null, "name": "zcode-kaola-project-runner"}, {"_meta": {"bareName": "kaola-workflow-finalize", "path": "/Users/ylmacstudio/.grok/commands/kaola-workflow-finalize.md", "qualifiedName": "user:kaola-workflow-finalize", "scope": "user"}, "description": "Kaola-Workflow Finalization. Record the acceptance evidence, write the summary, then close, archive, commit, and sink.", "input": null, "name": "kaola-workflow-finalize"}, {"_meta": {"bareName": "workflow-init", "path": "/Users/ylmacstudio/.grok/commands/workflow-init.md", "qualifiedName": "user:workflow-init", "scope": "user"}, "description": "Initialize a project for Kaola-Workflow with AGENTS.md guidance, docs structure, and Git/GitHub issue conventions.", "input": null, "name": "workflow-init"}, {"_meta": {"bareName": "workflow-next", "path": "/Users/ylmacstudio/.grok/commands/workflow-next.md", "qualifiedName": "user:workflow-next", "scope": "user"}, "description": "Workflow Next. Claims the work, writes the run's mission ledger, and runs it. Resumable from that one file.", "input": null, "name": "workflow-next"}, {"_meta": {"bareName": "kaola-delegator", "path": "/Users/ylmacstudio/.agents/skills/kaola-delegator/SKILL.md", "qualifiedName": "user:kaola-delegator", "scope": "user"}, "description": "Use when an outer Agent (Grok Bot, Codex, or generic) should delegate a project run through Kaola-Delegator to one CLI Host on any platform: extract the task, progress, Host platform, authorization, quota, priority, start or resume that Host via its platform Runner, and relay user changes without